What is the output of the following Java program invoking an interface method polymorphically?
```java
interface Auditable {
    String audit();
}
class FinancialReport implements Auditable {
    @Override
    public String audit() {
        return "PASSED";
    }
}
public class AuditApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Auditable report = new FinancialReport();
        System.out.println("Status: " + report.audit());
    }
}
```

